// Entra ID sign-in ingestion. NOTE THE TABLE NAME BY SURFACE:
//   Sentinel > Logs (Log Analytics):        SigninLogs
//   Defender Advanced Hunting (unified):    EntraIdSignInEvents
// Same sign-in data, two schema names. Querying the wrong one for your surface
// returns "no data" and can read as a licensing failure when the data is present.
// Sign-in ingestion requires Entra P1/P2 (confirmed live via the E5 trial).
SigninLogs
| where TimeGenerated > ago(1h)
| project TimeGenerated, UserPrincipalName, ResultType, AppDisplayName, IPAddress, Location
| order by TimeGenerated desc
